mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>A spiky trap. Don't touch!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/0c0c7eed4c6994cf08f45832b2d07d78.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Is there more to discover?</h2>Sure there is, just look.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/54c37433803a97963fb224e8b294b2ce.webp?t=1705088457\" /></div><br>A selection of useful gadgets awaits you. If you have enough money of course.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/c0b3cbb8bf4cbe144dc7894f2b0925b1.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Fly around like a bird and attack from above, with the jetpack. Just like a bird does...?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e9b1d316e3aea265a11b36f0015a64c0.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=