d. Sharp as a...sword.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/713f9af6fb7195cef2e2819a7da7ce2b.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Grenades too, of course! What else?<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/e98ab8092112db4ba7089fdc5cfa0dd3.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">And now?</h2>Add it to your wishlist or buy it. <br>Or join the Steam Community Hub and meet some other Pavephobians.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/a9f63183f37dacd57ca51b3860332241.avif?t=1705088457\" /></div><br><br>and don't forget to add it to your wishlist...<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/ac490ceb1baaa95abd9cc349acc69f2f.webp?t=1705088457\" /></div><br>And if you're reading this, then you've scrolled down to here and looked at all the beautiful gifs that I've painstakingly cut together. Many thanks and here is your bonus gif.<br>See you in Pavephobia!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/34b989ec49be2aaaabc34fc1061d3033.poster.avif?t=1705088457\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/34b989ec49be2aaaabc34fc1061d3033.webm?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2204880/extras/34b989ec49be2aaaabc34fc1061d3033.mp4?t=1705088457\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
